<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>503 — Service Unavailable · Scan to See</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,300..700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        :root {
            --bg:      #0f0a07;
            --accent:  #E8A020;
            --muted:   #7a6a5a;
            --sand:    #fffbf4;
            --border:  rgba(255,255,255,.08);
        }

        html, body { height: 100%; }

        body {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--sand);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 24px;
        }

        /* ── Brand ── */
        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 56px;
        }
        .brand img {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            object-fit: contain;
        }
        .brand-name {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.85);
            letter-spacing: .02em;
        }

        /* ── Error card ── */
        .card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 52px 48px;
            max-width: 520px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .err-icon {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .err-code {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1;
            color: var(--accent);
            letter-spacing: -.03em;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .err-title {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .err-body {
            font-size: .95rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.45);
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 36px;
        }

        /* ── Pulsing dot ── */
        .pulse-wrap {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .pulse-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
            animation: pulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .pulse-dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .2s; }
        .pulse-dot:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .4s; }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: .2; transform: scale(.8); }
            50%       { opacity: 1;  transform: scale(1.1); }
        }

        /* ── Button ── */
        .btn-home {
            display: inline-block;
            background: transparent;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: .9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 11px 26px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
            transition: border-color .15s, color .15s, transform .12s;
            letter-spacing: .01em;
        }
        .btn-home:hover {
            border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.5);
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        .foot {
            margin-top: 48px;
            font-size: .75rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.18);
        }

        @media (max-width: 540px) {
            .card { padding: 36px 24px; }
            .err-code { font-size: 4.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="brand">
        <img src="{{ asset('image/logoS2S.png') }}" alt="S2S logo">
        <span class="brand-name">Scan to See</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="err-icon">🍽️</div>
        <div class="err-code">503</div>
        <h1 class="err-title">We're temporarily off the menu</h1>
        <p class="err-body">
            The kitchen is closed for a quick tune-up.<br>
            We'll be back up and serving in just a moment — hang tight!
        </p>
        <div class="pulse-wrap">
            <div class="pulse-dot"></div>
            <div class="pulse-dot"></div>
            <div class="pulse-dot"></div>
        </div>
        <a href="/" class="btn-home">Try the homepage</a>
    </div>

    <p class="foot">&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Scan to See. All rights reserved.</p>

</body>
</html>
